exports[`cli golden: error paths xray help nosuch 1`] = `
"exit: 0
--- stdout ---

--- stderr ---
Usage: xray [options] [command]

X-ray your codebase - Generate AST, CFG, and DFG visualizations

Options:
  -V, --version              output the version number
  -v, --verbose [level]      Set verbosity level: silent, error, warn, info
                             (default), debug (default: "info")
  --config <path>            Path to config file (auto-detect if not specified)
  --no-telemetry             Disable telemetry for this session
  --quiet                    Suppress info and success output (errors still
                             shown)
  --no-color                 Disable ANSI color output
  -C, --chdir <path>         Change to <path> before running the command
  -h, --help                 display help for command

Commands:
  map [options]              Generate visual map of codebase
  scan [options]             Scan and discover files in codebase
  graph [options]            Generate control flow (CFG) and data flow (DFG)
                             graphs
  query [options] [query]    Query call graph using function-based syntax
  strategy                   Manage strategies (list, create, install, remove,
                             enable, disable, info)
  alias                      Manage command aliases
  lang                       Manage language packs (tree-sitter grammars)
  cache                      Cache management
  paths [options]            Show xray's active config, cache DB, and project
                             root
  describe [options]         Emit machine-readable capability surface (12fc
                             Factor 1)
  completion <shell>         Generate shell completion script
  build                      build commands
  cicd                       cicd commands
  config                     config commands
  container                  container commands
  express                    express commands
  go-cli                     go-cli commands
  infrastructure             infrastructure commands
  markdown                   markdown commands
  package-manager            package-manager commands
  react                      react commands
  rest-api                   rest-api commands
  explore [options] [query]  Quickly find files by patterns, search code for
                             keywords, or explore codebase [default command]
  help [command]             display help for command

Groups:
  ANALYZE:     map  scan  graph  query  explore
  STRATEGY:    strategy  build  cicd  config  container  express  infrastructure  markdown  package-manager  react  rest-api
  MANAGEMENT:  alias  cache  completion  describe  paths

"
`;

